## Files & Buffers

    <leader>e | Toggle file tree
    <leader>o | Focus file tree
    <leader>ff | Find files
    <leader>fg | Live grep
    <leader>fb | Open buffers
    <leader>fr | Recent files
    <leader>fc | Find word under cursor
    <leader>fd | Diagnostics list
    <leader>fh | Help tags
    <leader>w | Save file
    <leader>q | Quit
    <leader>Q | Force quit all
    <leader>bd | Delete buffer
    Shift+H | Previous buffer
    Shift+L | Next buffer

## LSP

    gd | Go to definition
    gr | References
    gi | Implementations
    gt | Type definition
    K | Hover docs
    <leader>ca | Code action
    <leader>rn | Rename symbol
    <leader>lf | Format file
    <leader>ld | Show diagnostic float
    ]d | Next diagnostic
    [d | Prev diagnostic

## Git

    <leader>gp | Preview hunk
    <leader>gs | Stage hunk
    <leader>gr | Reset hunk
    <leader>gb | Blame line
    ]g | Next hunk
    [g | Prev hunk

## Navigation

    Ctrl+H | Move to left split
    Ctrl+J | Move to lower split
    Ctrl+K | Move to upper split
    Ctrl+L | Move to right split
    <leader>sv | Vertical split
    <leader>sh | Horizontal split
    <leader>sx | Close split
    Ctrl+D | Scroll down (centered)
    Ctrl+U | Scroll up (centered)
    s | Flash jump
    S | Flash treesitter

## Editing

    gcc | Toggle line comment
    gc | Toggle block comment (visual)
    J | Move line down (visual)
    K | Move line up (visual)
    < | Dedent (stay visual)
    > | Indent (stay visual)
    <leader>p | Paste without overwriting register
    <leader>y | Yank to system clipboard
    <leader>d | Delete without yanking

## Completion

    Ctrl+Space | Trigger completion
    Ctrl+J | Next item
    Ctrl+K | Prev item
    Enter | Confirm item
    Ctrl+E | Abort menu
    Tab | Expand snippet

## Themes

    <leader>tt | Theme switcher (Themery)
    <leader>ft | Colorscheme picker (Telescope)

## Misc

    <leader>? | This cheatsheet
    :Lazy | Plugin manager
    :Mason | LSP installer
    :checkhealth | Diagnose setup

